<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">emblēma</span></b> , ătis
			(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abl.
			plur.</i> emblematis, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 22</span></i>; *
				<i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 4, 27</span></i>), n., =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμβλημα</span>, <i>inlaid work.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Raised ornaments</i> on vessels, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2,
				4, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">22</span></i> sq.; <i><span class="en">Dig. 34,
				2, 32</span></i> et saep.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Tessellated work</i>, <i>mosaic</i>,
			Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Or. 44</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. de
				Or. 3, 43, 171</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Brut. 79, 274</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 3, 2, 4</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
